# Exceptions to the tile-crate rule (tests/dependency_ratchet.rs): a crate named `iyakki-tile-*` may depend on `iyakki-uikit` and nothing else
# named `iyakki-*`, unless a line here says so. One line per exception: <tile crate> <dependency> <why, until when>.
# The list may only shrink: a line that no longer matches a real dependency fails the test until it is removed.
# (Empty: `iyakki-tile-usage` needs only `iyakki-uikit` and `iyakki-tile-api`, see docs/development/COMPILE-SPLIT-PILOT.md.)
